<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-a89b3969 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/www.zeffy.com\/en-US\/ticketing\/hyper-fix--5\">Reserve your spot here!<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n<style>.wp-block-kadence-spacer.kt-block-spacer-9914_6fae2c-7c .kt-block-spacer{height:60px;}.wp-block-kadence-spacer.kt-block-spacer-9914_6fae2c-7c .kt-divider{border-top-width:1px;height:1px;border-top-color:var(--ast-global-color-6);width:80%;border-top-style:solid;}<\/style>\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-spacer aligncenter kt-block-spacer-9914_6fae2c-7c\"><div class=\"kt-block-spacer kt-block-spacer-halign-center\"><hr class=\"kt-divider\"\/><\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text has-media-on-the-right is-stacked-on-mobile\" style=\"border-style:none;border-width:0px;border-top-left-radius:0px;border-top-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-left-radius:0px;border-bottom-right-radius:0px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;padding-top:0;padding-right:0;padding-bottom:0;padding-left:0;font-size:18px;grid-template-columns:auto 47%\"><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-advanced-heading uagb-block-17d69b4a\"><h2 class=\"uagb-heading-text\">Want to be a queen?<\/h2><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Create your character. Build your look. Take the stage.<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p style=\"border-style:none;border-width:0px\"><em>Drag in Three Acts <\/em>is a beginner-friendly, three-day experience that takes you from your first drag idea to your debut performance.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Day One:<\/span><\/strong> Develop your drag persona and learn makeup, hair, and wig basics.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Day Two:<\/span><\/strong> Build your look and practice movement, stage presence, and your performance.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Day Three:<\/strong> <\/span> Make your drag debut at a live brunch showcase.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>No experience required. Dates, pricing, and location are coming soon.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Interested in taking the stage? Join the waitlist to be the first to receive updates and get early access when registration opens.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-a89b3969 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/docs.google.com\/forms\/d\/e\/1FAIpQLSeCHx_1EFjJJ1ZYqXwYC0_uOdzecH1aVwvbuHigkfiJwMS3JA\/viewform?usp=sharing&amp;ouid=111565715290194078754\">Join the interest list here!<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1350\" src=\"https:\/\/cutestoryevents.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/teaser-drag-in-3-1.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-9966 size-full\" srcset=\"https:\/\/cutestoryevents.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/teaser-drag-in-3-1.png 1080w, https:\/\/cutestoryevents.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/teaser-drag-in-3-1-240x300.png 240w, https:\/\/cutestoryevents.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/teaser-drag-in-3-1-819x1024.png 819w, https:\/\/cutestoryevents.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/teaser-drag-in-3-1-768x960.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1080px) 100vw, 1080px\" \/><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-left is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-fc4fd283 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"","protected":false},"author":3,"featured_media":1487,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","templat